# SOLUTION
msgid "solution.title"
msgstr "Solution - Dulno"
msgid "solution.headline"
msgstr "Solution"
msgid "solution.slogan"
msgstr "Let us convince you"
msgid "solution.description.1"
msgstr "We are convinced that Dulno can be integrated into anyone's workflows."
msgid "solution.description.2"
msgstr "Are you not sure? We'll show you."
msgid "solution.jobs.headline"
msgstr "Jobs"
msgid "solution.jobs.slogan"
msgstr "That's how versatile Dulno is"
msgid "solution.jobs.description.1"
msgstr "Here you will find letious ideas on how to use Dulno in different areas."
msgid "solution.jobs.description.2"
msgstr "This is just a small selection. There are many areas of application for Dulno."
msgid "solution.jobs.description.3"
msgstr "The only limitation is your creativity."
msgid "solution.jobs.sales"
msgstr "Sales"
msgid "solution.jobs.sales.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Acceleration of order processing"
msgid "solution.jobs.sales.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Automate your order processing to provide your customers with your product as quickly as possible"
msgid "solution.jobs.sales.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Contract administration"
msgid "solution.jobs.sales.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Manage or generate contracts with Dulno to save time and keep track of the status of your customers"
msgid "solution.jobs.sales.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Find and engage leads"
msgid "solution.jobs.sales.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Keep your leads interested in your product by making the entire process up to the conclusion of the contract as simple and quick as possible for your customers"
msgid "solution.jobs.marketing"
msgstr "Marketing"
msgid "solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Launch of campaigns"
msgid "solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Publish campaigns at set times to acquire new customers at regular intervals"
msgid "solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Content generation"
msgid "solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Generate and publish new content on letious social media platforms to keep your customers up to date about your products"
msgid "solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "All in one"
msgid "solution.jobs.marketing.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Bundle your numerous channels on our platform to maintain the best possible overview of your campaigns. We manage all your high-profile accounts at once"
msgid "solution.jobs.finances"
msgstr "Finances"
msgid "solution.jobs.finances.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Maintaining an overview"
msgid "solution.jobs.finances.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Use Dulno to manage your finances clearly, for example by recording all transactions in a Google Docs document and printing them out automatically on a regular basis"
msgid "solution.jobs.finances.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Automate customer invoices"
msgid "solution.jobs.finances.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Improve your cash flow by automating the creation, management and distribution of customer invoices"
msgid "solution.jobs.finances.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Backup important documents"
msgid "solution.jobs.finances.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Save important documents not only in paper form, but also digitally and upload them fully automatically and regularly to a cloud of your choice"
msgid "solution.jobs.hr"
msgstr "Human Resources"
msgid "solution.jobs.hr.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Employee processes"
msgid "solution.jobs.hr.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Automate the onboarding / offboarding of employees and record the process in dulno processes"
msgid "solution.jobs.hr.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Overview of employees"
msgid "solution.jobs.hr.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Keep an overview of your employees by, for example, always keeping employee data up to date through workflows"
msgid "solution.jobs.hr.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Employee recruitment"
msgid "solution.jobs.hr.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Use Dulno to continuously find the best employees on the market. Make them aware of your company through targeted campaigns and retain them"
msgid "solution.jobs.developer"
msgstr "Developers"
msgid "solution.jobs.developer.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Webhook connection"
msgid "solution.jobs.developer.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Use our webhooks to connect any of your applications to Dulno and trigger workflows or receive results from workflows"
msgid "solution.jobs.developer.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "A better customer experience"
msgid "solution.jobs.developer.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Offer your customers a better experience with your applications by integrating the apps your customers use every day into your applications without a lot of work"
msgid "solution.jobs.developer.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Involve employees"
msgid "solution.jobs.developer.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Involve regular employees in the development process, for example by creating new Github issues when bugs occur without the employee needing direct Github access"
msgid "solution.jobs.creatives"
msgstr "Creatives"
msgid "solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Work backup"
msgid "solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Synchronize your work, directly from your device, automatically with a cloud like Google Drive so your data is never lost again"
msgid "solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Publication of work"
msgid "solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Plan and publish your work completely automatically by uploading it to a platform of your choice, for example"
msgid "solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Conversion of files"
msgid "solution.jobs.creatives.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Use Dulno to automatically convert files into different formats to avoid unnecessary and repetitive work"
msgid "solution.jobs.support"
msgstr "Support"
msgid "solution.jobs.support.use.case.1.title"
msgstr "Notifications"
msgid "solution.jobs.support.use.case.1.description"
msgstr "Receive notifications when new emails or requests are received"
msgid "solution.jobs.support.use.case.2.title"
msgstr "Automatic reply"
msgid "solution.jobs.support.use.case.2.description"
msgstr "Generate and send AI-generated responses to keep your customers happy"
msgid "solution.jobs.support.use.case.3.title"
msgstr "Forwarding of requests"
msgid "solution.jobs.support.use.case.3.description"
msgstr "Forward inquiries fully automatically to the right department to serve your customers as quickly as possible"
msgid "solution.apps.headline"
msgstr "Apps"
msgid "solution.apps.slogan"
msgstr "Let yourself be inspired"
msgid "solution.apps.description.1"
msgstr "Here you can see a few of the apps we offer."
msgid "solution.apps.description.2"
msgstr "Perhaps you see a constellation that appeals to you."
msgid "solution.get.headline"
msgstr "Interested?"
msgid "solution.get.slogan"
msgstr "Get Dulno now!"
msgid "solution.get.description"
msgstr "If you are now interested in our product, you can find out about our letious offers and packages. There is sure to be something for you."
msgid "solution.get.button"
msgstr "GET IT NOW"

